                                                "sense_id": "6b57c03e-a2dd-3f25-a9c7-b80fa00678de",
                                                "text": "The driver remained at his post, while telling fireman Jim Nightall to get down on the track and run back to uncouple the burning wagon from the rest."
                                            }
